{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "645951f2e5f8fb4c81ee48abe8069384b1af514ddb413ea52f4cc09292cb7c04", "ja": "（静香の応援団ポスターがかなり好評で、\n『アイグラ！！』からインタビューの依頼が来た）", "zh": "（静香的应援团海报颇受好评，\n《I‧G‧R‧A！！》希望采访她。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9cfe62ceab32ad06218231fd666d400e80027deafff6699724c33fca9cd47a6b", "ja": "（もちろん、テーマは『応援』。\n静香は、何を話すのかな……）", "zh": "（主题当然是『声援』。\n静香会说些什么呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1002_interviewer", "source_sha256": "1e7f7c79d46757c4a3b0a2fc005ae885510683f8b13bbad79c306283f52f02e8", "ja": "今回、最上さんの応援ポスターに、力をもらったという\n受験生が、とても多かったそうですよ。", "zh": "听说这次最上小姐的声援海报\n激励了许多考生喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "dda96cd057453249ffe1c57d9b6c3560209438a473b39bcdc80d3ea873755b75", "ja": "そんな、私なんて……。自分なりに\n一生懸命やらせていただきましたが、まだまだです！", "zh": "太过奖了，我哪有这么厉害……\n虽然我自认已经全力以赴了，但还做得不够好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "f5b1075acfbff9ec365c9663a891e334e753e87948f8fb31dc4ba1aca719bef2", "ja": "みなさん、きっとたくさん努力されたと思いますから。\n受験、本当にお疲れさまでした！", "zh": "我想各位考生一定都非常努力。\n大家参加考试真的辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1005_interviewer", "source_sha256": "c7e56ac4953abc8b6105578afd65c9f54dd78056dd82373b20a5d0960d16e960", "ja": "では最後に、夢を叶えようとしている\n読者のみなさんに、応援のメッセージをお願いします！", "zh": "那么，最后请你说一句话，\n为努力实现梦想的各位读者打气吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "48886d93917799a820f5ed6e30a801d3ad43c99d909412e17a843805f886fead", "ja": "は、はい！　……私も今、夢を叶えるために\nいろいろ勉強をしています。", "zh": "好、好的！\n……我也正为了圆梦而多方学习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "7f4cb2a4e2dd2342b402a40263734ac1ee418a326d1c0c8718869576f496f251", "ja": "私の夢は、努力だけではダメかもしれなくて……\nそんなに簡単に叶えられないって、わかってます。", "zh": "我的梦想也许光靠努力无法实现……\n我明白梦想没有那么容易成真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "28d1b2e537cbdf9688286ea6f59d42378bb8d4183014035f61a4d3a9e0e30945", "ja": "でも私は、絶対に諦めません。\n……この夢、みなさんと一緒に、叶えたいです！", "zh": "但是我绝对不会放弃。\n……我想跟各位一起实现这个梦想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1009_p", "source_sha256": "766f2a7d668e7e4e183cf2b7f3ba257d1e3093a4b7d8a5ec1a98e18e900e5cc2", "ja": "静香、お疲れさま！\nインタビュー、いい感じだったみたいだな。", "zh": "静香，辛苦你了！\n采访感觉表现得不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "b9e5a908fdb5991cf896a4e14c874cfcfe07fe113878f3b1a495dce5be294452", "ja": "すごく、緊張しました。\nあの……私、なにか変なこと言ってませんでしたか？", "zh": "我刚才非常紧张。\n那个……我有没有说出奇怪的话？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c549e4ef15c8278cabbc168fed5e5c4c192c6c219927b2769b3360acd468be08", "ja": "いや、『応援』のテーマにも沿ってたし、\n受け答えも静香らしくて良かったよ。", "zh": "没有，你的回答很好，既符合『声援』这个主题，\n也很有静香你的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "7ac5f6cd3f63220dc1f27adce1a25d0c469fcd4f9ece6d181dfe8a3400b22a7f", "ja": "私らしくって……\nあの、具体的にどんな感じだったんですか？", "zh": "有我的风格……\n请问具体来说是怎样的感觉呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0f773ddb4a636a16b9ecf5350749ceadcb9a7c5250fa7e4777c8f627c5e43235", "ja": "そうだな。夢について話す静香の言葉が、\nまっすぐ伝わってきたよ。", "zh": "我想想，\n静香谈到梦想时，说的话令人感觉非常直率。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "d5171489469fbda63c0bb695e29fd697649726b8682ea6d88853e34916553431", "ja": "そ、そうですか。まっすぐな言葉……それって、\nいいことですよね？　{$P$}。", "zh": "是、是吗？令人感觉直率的话……\n这应该是好事吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cb8fbf3ee070cee89d2a670c679228d58adb28f1d0bd7ff7376b2bdbbfce0017", "ja": "ああ。静香のインタビューを聞いていたら、\n俺も自分の夢を頑張ろうって思ったよ。", "zh": "是啊，听过静香的采访后，\n我也想要努力实现自己的梦想了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "dd1b1140d0663e27aba6da9aee12ce25e1892d1126b41bc2052c070aee94e88f", "ja": "{$P$}にも、夢があるんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}也有梦想吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1017_p", "source_sha256": "48ab1d77f3665178d5b807fe7ad36da1ed31fe93149cf5cdbc0958e41fbfb8da", "ja": "もちろん。静香の夢を、\n1日でも早く叶えるっていう夢があるよ。", "zh": "当然有。\n我的梦想是早日实现静香的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "f9997ec17efacc4697e9ad9d3b6fa70fb1e174066d2576bb6b10d422a7694d3d", "ja": "えっ！？　……そ、そうですよね。\nわ、わかってくれてるならいいんです……。", "zh": "咦！？说、说得也是。\n你、你能理解就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "271520725ff4edbdfcffeae3ce3760c6dba5bdd10758188e700e52e77988833e", "ja": "そ、それなら{$P$}も、受験生の\nみんなと同じくらい、一生懸命にならないとですね！", "zh": "既、既然如此，{$P$}也要\n跟所有考生一样拚命努力才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0114_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "36f5f467e2a3f15340882c70526ce048a1960e92b948936880bf3241f40d8e21", "ja": "聞いてるんですか、{$P$}？\nな、何を笑ってるんですか！　もう！", "zh": "{$P$}，你有在听吗？\n你、你在笑什么啊！讨厌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
